<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Chiron said cut by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Chiron said cut by Goldman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Chiron Corp has had its rating cut by Goldman Sachs to a market perform from its prior rating of trading buy.</p>
<p>-- Chiron shares were off 3-1/8 to 18-3/4 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- The company said earlier it would not seek a product license aplication for its prophylactic genital herpes vaccine, because data from a data trial did not indicate efficacy.</p>
</text>
